      "httpStatus": 200,
      "paraphrase": "Powered-up contact heals its caster,then nearby allies,before critical damage. Both restoration components are lifesteal-class and use the caster amplification. The lower-critical-priority sentence does not settle every higher-critical consumption case.",
      "versionContext": "Direct complete historical HTML capture20230215191331. Relevant sections actually read and SHA verified. Full third-party HTML stays ignored;no silent modern mechanism import."
    },
    {
      "id": "lifesteal-2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215192108id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Lifesteal",
      "sha256": "e6ed9ce3f16c7b3b406a739d076c3a7ccecd072f8459c886629ec9da1e35db58",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "paraphrase": "Ordinary physical attack lifesteal includes the packet a dying target would have taken without death. Dawnbreaker is in the regular source list without the no-overkill footnote,which belongs to Marci/Jingu. Most target generic multipliers do not affect lifesteal;FleshGolem/AeonDisk are stated examples. Exact shield/deferred conversions are not specified here.",
      "versionContext": "Direct complete historical HTML capture20230215192108. Relevant sections actually read and SHA verified. Full third-party HTML stays ignored;no silent modern mechanism import."
    },
    {
      "id": "zeus-2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215192015id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Zeus",
      "sha256": "12b3d928f7d8a031a9d49c811fed07ae337436911b8d308220b838843d8a1edc",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "paraphrase": "Native StaticField damage precedes every effect of each triggering Zeus ability. Native Shard8percent/Zeus-only behavior is not substituted for AA4/6/10and any-learned-ability/three-second-lock custom data. The native immediate-nuke examples do not independently resolve all AA delayedDOT/debuff-only callers.",
      "versionContext": "Direct complete historical HTML capture20230215192015. Relevant sections actually read and SHA verified. Full third-party HTML stays ignored;no silent modern mechanism import."
    },
    {
      "id": "lancer-2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215191831id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Phantom_Lancer",
      "sha256": "457d64b68abd62cdf42d6b268fe74329a8533752d004a5290bc64c4e82102889",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "paraphrase": "Owned illusions within675perform full fake cast animation and release harmless fake lances simultaneously with a real release. Parent cancellation retains their animation without releasing fake lances. Moving/attacking illusions retain their orders/facing;fake lances do not interact with targets.",
      "versionContext": "Direct complete historical HTML capture20230215191831. Relevant sections actually read and SHA verified. Full third-party HTML stays ignored;no silent modern mechanism import."
    },
    {
      "id": "necro-2023",
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20230215192013id_/https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Necrophos",
      "sha256": "4b8ce05f1d59ea336df588723eef7d0f69929ff45ec186ecf40aa42c23157bb2",
      "accessedOn": "2026-10-30",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "paraphrase": "ReapersScythe explicitly has the highest kill-credit manipulation priority. The existing shared mark protocol is reused and verified against a real IceBlast shatter caused by a third attacker;damage attribution stays independent.",
      "versionContext": "Direct complete historical HTML capture20230215192013. Relevant sections actually read and SHA verified. Full third-party HTML stays ignored;no silent modern mechanism import."
    },
